    "ja": "そのメイド危険につき"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Melissa has inherited a billion yen ring from her grandmother. Melissa hires a bodyguard to protect her, but it turns out to be a “male maid”! Arthur, with his strong body and maid's uniform, gracefully performs his maid duties while knocking down ring-hunters one by one. Melissa is puzzled by his eccentricity, but as she spends time with him, her heart slowly begins to unravel. \n\nThe days begin to get a little too exciting with a dangerous maid under one roof.\n\n---\nNote: It was previously a One-Shot that received a lot of popularity and then became a series."
  },
